00:50:55.740 --> 00:50:59.620
And I would also say that this particular series
我还要说的是，这部特定的剧集

1273
00:50:59.620 --> 00:51:01.860
had so many things to talk about.
有太多值得讨论的话题了。

1274
00:51:01.860 --> 00:51:04.060
You could talk about it for a week.
你可以讨论整整一个星期。

1275
00:51:04.060 --> 00:51:04.900
Yeah.
对。

1276
00:51:04.900 --> 00:51:05.740
Yeah.
对。

1277
00:51:05.740 --> 00:51:06.580
I mean, look at us.
我是说，看看我们。

1278
00:51:06.580 --> 00:51:07.420
It's giving us a lot to talk.
这给我们提供了很多聊资。

1279
00:51:07.420 --> 00:51:09.180
So many episodes have cliffhangers.
很多集都有悬念。

1280
00:51:09.180 --> 00:51:11.540
So not just the finale episodes of seasons,
不仅是每季的季终集，

1281
00:51:11.540 --> 00:51:13.140
but there's cliffhangers all along the way.
而且整个过程中到处都是悬念。

1282
00:51:13.140 --> 00:51:14.540
There's like little mysteries.
就像一个个小谜团。

1283
00:51:14.540 --> 00:51:16.940
Who was sabotaging Barney?
是谁在破坏巴尼的计划？

1284
00:51:16.940 --> 00:51:17.940
Four episodes ago.
在四集之前。

1285
00:51:17.940 --> 00:51:18.780
Guess what?
你猜怎么着？

1286
00:51:18.780 --> 00:51:19.620
You're going to find out.
你马上就会知道了。

1287
00:51:19.620 --> 00:51:20.900
Turns out it's Britney Spears again.
结果发现又是布兰妮·斯皮尔斯。

1288
00:51:20.900 --> 00:51:21.740
She is back.
她又回来了。

1289
00:51:21.740 --> 00:51:24.340
There's something fun about having to wait for it.
不得不等待这种事本身就很有趣。

1290
00:51:26.020 --> 00:51:27.900
You could also, you could talk about a pencil
你还可以，你可以讨论一根铅笔

1291
00:51:27.900 --> 00:51:29.940
in the nose for three days.
插在鼻子里的事讨论三天。

1292
00:51:29.940 --> 00:51:31.940
You need to process that.
你需要消化这个。

1293
00:51:31.940 --> 00:51:32.780
You know, it's true.
你知道的，确实如此。

1294
00:51:32.780 --> 00:51:34.180
If you watch it all on a bunch of them in a row,
如果你一口气连续看好几集，

1295
00:51:34.180 --> 00:51:35.740
it's like, things are moving really fast
就会觉得，事情进展得太快了

1296
00:51:35.740 --> 00:51:37.580
between Ted and the Sarah Chocolate Lady.
在泰德和那个莎拉巧克力女士之间。

1297
00:51:37.580 --> 00:51:38.620
What's going on?
这到底是怎么回事？

1298
00:51:38.620 --> 00:51:40.540
But if there's something about having to wait a week
但如果必须等上一周的话，感觉就完全不同了，

1299
00:51:40.540 --> 00:51:42.660
and it feels like, oh, a bunch of stuff happened
好像在我们没注意的时候，

1300
00:51:42.660 --> 00:51:43.500
when we weren't looking.
发生了好多事情。

1301
00:51:43.500 --> 00:51:44.340
It makes sense.
这很合情合理。

1302
00:51:44.340 --> 00:51:45.780
Your brain kind of fills it in.
你的大脑会进行某种程度的补全。

1303
00:51:45.780 --> 00:51:48.620
There's a certain, it was written for that, right?
有一种特定的，它就是为此而写的，对吧？

1304
00:51:48.620 --> 00:51:49.940
It was written for that.
它就是为此而写的。

1305
00:51:49.940 --> 00:51:51.660
And it's people binge it.
而且人们会疯狂刷剧。

1306
00:51:51.660 --> 00:51:53.100
I love that it plays so well, binging.
我喜欢它非常适合一口气刷完这一点。

1307
00:51:53.100 --> 00:51:54.620
But there's something lost, I think,
但我觉得还是有些东西丢失了，

1308
00:51:54.780 --> 00:51:58.820
and also, you know how, in religions,
而且，你知道吗，就像在宗教里，

1309
00:51:58.820 --> 00:52:02.420
holidays, a lot of them correspond with the harvest
很多节日都对应着丰收

1310
00:52:02.420 --> 00:52:04.700
and the season, like the fact that we would do
和季节，比如我们会制作

1311
00:52:04.700 --> 00:52:06.780
like a Halloween episode around Halloween
万圣节特辑在万圣节前后

1312
00:52:06.780 --> 00:52:08.940
in a Christmas episode in a,
以及圣诞节特辑在，

1313
00:52:08.940 --> 00:52:10.340
like in order to the universe.
就像是为了顺应宇宙规律。

1314
00:52:10.340 --> 00:52:11.980
It was almost like we were honoring
感觉就像我们是在向

1315
00:52:11.980 --> 00:52:15.980
the waves of time a little bit more of the seasons.
时间的波澜以及季节致敬一样。

1316
00:52:15.980 --> 00:52:18.020
Like we were just a little more hooked
就像我们与

1317
00:52:18.020 --> 00:52:19.700
into the natural flow of.
大自然的自然规律

1318
00:52:19.700 --> 00:52:22.340
Why is this finale different from all other finales?
联系得更紧密了一些。

1319
00:52:24.780 --> 00:52:26.660
But yeah, there's a nice,
为什么这个大结局与所有其他大结局不同？

1320
00:52:26.660 --> 00:52:28.940
there's the shared ritualistic part of it.
不过是的，有一种美好的、

1321
00:52:28.940 --> 00:52:31.740
And I mean, that's what it was like making the show.
带有共享的仪式感的部分。

1322
00:52:31.740 --> 00:52:35.060
We were all going through life together in this way
我的意思是，制作这部剧的时候就是这样的。

1323
00:52:35.060 --> 00:52:37.180
and going through the seasons together.
我们都以这种方式一起经历生活，

1324
00:52:37.180 --> 00:52:41.020
And this roller coaster ride of this nine episodes
一起经历四季的变换。

1325
00:52:41.020 --> 00:52:45.860
after the strike was, if we weren't like bonded together
罢工结束后这九集就像坐过山车一样，如果我们之前没有紧密团结在一起

1326
00:52:45.860 --> 00:52:48.420
but before then, which we were, this really,
——虽然我们本来就很团结——这绝对，

1327
00:52:48.420 --> 00:52:49.780
and this was such proof, Pam,
帕姆，这简直是最好的证明，

1328
00:52:49.780 --> 00:52:54.780
of how locked in your stage 22 on the Fox slide was.
证明了福克斯22号摄影棚的凝聚力有多强。

1329
00:52:55.180 --> 00:52:56.020
I agree.
我同意。

1330
00:52:56.020 --> 00:52:58.340
The crew and everybody in there,
剧组和那里的每个人，

1331
00:52:58.340 --> 00:53:00.380
everybody in post, the production team, the crew,
后期制作的每个人、制片团队、演职人员，

1332
00:53:00.380 --> 00:53:03.900
this, like everybody, God, what had to happen
这个，就像每个人，天哪，为了拍出那九集

1333
00:53:03.900 --> 00:53:06.140
to do those nine episodes was, I don't think people,
所必须经历的一切，我觉得大家，

1334
00:53:06.140 --> 00:53:08.940
it's hard to explain it to the people who weren't there.
很难向不在现场的人解释清楚。

1335
00:53:08.940 --> 00:53:12.380
And all of those people couldn't wait for season four.
所有这些人当时都迫不及待地想要第四季了。

1336
00:53:12.380 --> 00:53:14.340
Yeah, we scared away zero people
是的，我们没有吓跑任何人，

1337
00:53:14.340 --> 00:53:16.500
with every crazy thing we asked them to figure out.
对于我们提出的每一个疯狂的要求，他们都想方设法去解决。

1338
00:53:16.500 --> 00:53:17.860
It was more like, now I'm there than you were.
更像是，现在我的投入比你还多。

1339
00:53:17.860 --> 00:53:19.340
I'm gonna come back more.
我要更深度地参与进来。

1340
00:53:19.340 --> 00:53:20.180
Yeah, me more.
没错，我更想这样。

1341
00:53:20.180 --> 00:53:21.900
So a few people got let go and how I met your mother,
所以在《老爸老妈浪漫史》里只有少数人离开，

1342
00:53:21.900 --> 00:53:23.540
if you left how I met your mother,
如果你离开了《老爸老妈浪漫史》，

1343
00:53:23.540 --> 00:53:25.940
it was because you were retiring from this.
那一定是因为你要退休了。

1344
00:53:25.940 --> 00:53:29.540
You were like, I would like to spend time with my grandkids.
你会说，我想多花点时间陪陪孙子孙女。

1345
00:53:29.540 --> 00:53:31.620
Like, you know, like.
就像，你知道的，诸如此类。

1346
00:53:31.620 --> 00:53:32.460
Absolutely.
完全正确。

1347
00:53:32.460 --> 00:53:34.780
Almost, almost nobody.
几乎，几乎没有人离开。

1348
00:53:34.780 --> 00:53:36.780
Yeah, we were really, really lucky.
是的，我们真的、真的很幸运。

1349
00:53:36.780 --> 00:53:39.820
I remember Peter left, camera, I forget what Pete,
我记得彼得离开了，负责摄像的，我忘了皮特叫什么，

1350
00:53:39.820 --> 00:53:42.580
camera, I'd love to be here and tell a lovely guy.
摄像师，我很想在这里提起他，一个非常可爱的人。

1351
00:53:42.580 --> 00:53:44.860
Yeah, he retired.
对，他退休了。

1352
00:53:44.860 --> 00:53:46.860
Yeah, so many amazing people.
对，有那么多不可思议的人。

1353
00:53:46.860 --> 00:53:48.620
Pami, you bring that out of people,
帕米，你总能让大家展现出那一面，

1354
00:53:48.620 --> 00:53:50.220
you bring the best out of people.
你总能激发大家最好的一面。

1355
00:53:50.220 --> 00:53:51.900
Oh, no, I can't be ever say it.
哦，不，我永远说不出这种话。

1356
00:53:51.900 --> 00:53:53.380
I'm so lucky.
我太幸运了。

1357
00:53:53.380 --> 00:53:54.700
I don't love you.
我不爱你。

1358
00:53:54.700 --> 00:53:56.580
We read a letter in the last episode
我们在上一集读了一封信，

1359
00:53:56.580 --> 00:53:59.660
where the letter writer said,
写信的人说，

1360
00:53:59.660 --> 00:54:02.540
it's the only show I know where the crew is famous too now
这是他知道的唯一一部连幕后工作人员现在也很有名的节目，

1361
00:54:02.540 --> 00:54:05.020
because of how much we talk about the crew.
因为我们太常谈论幕后团队了。

1362
00:54:05.020 --> 00:54:07.140
Oh, I'm great, that's bad.
哦，我太棒了，这可不好。

1363
00:54:07.140 --> 00:54:07.980
Yeah.
对。

1364
00:54:07.980 --> 00:54:08.820
That's what that's bad.
这就是……这可不好。

1365
00:54:08.820 --> 00:54:11.780
You know, you see the thing I think people don't understand
你知道的，我觉得人们不理解的一点是，

1366
00:54:11.780 --> 00:54:14.060
is like, you might skip the credits,
比如，你可能会跳过演职员表，

1367
00:54:14.060 --> 00:54:15.540
you might stay because you like the song
你可能会因为喜欢这首歌而留下来，

1368
00:54:15.540 --> 00:54:16.980
and talk to your friend afterwards.
然后和朋友聊一会儿。

1369
00:54:16.980 --> 00:54:20.620
Or they even on Netflix, it drives me crazy.
或者他们在Netflix上看的时候，这让我快疯了。

1370
00:54:20.620 --> 00:54:21.780
They go so faSt.
它们放得太快了。

1371
00:54:21.780 --> 00:54:23.100
Well, they'll minimize the box.
对，它们会把窗口缩小。

1372
00:54:23.100 --> 00:54:24.100
Yeah, I hate that.
对，我讨厌那样。

1373
00:54:24.100 --> 00:54:25.860
I hate that so much.
我太讨厌那样了。

1374
00:54:25.860 --> 00:54:26.860
It's terrible.
这太糟糕了。

1375
00:54:26.860 --> 00:54:27.700
How much I hate that.
我有多讨厌这个啊。

1376
00:54:27.700 --> 00:54:32.700
But when you are on a TV series and a long running TV series
但当你出演一部电视剧，一部长期播出的电视剧，

1377
00:54:32.700 --> 00:54:35.140
or you do a movie that's shooting for a long time,
或者你拍一部拍摄时间很长的电影时，

1378
00:54:35.140 --> 00:54:38.220
the crew is like, they're your people.
剧组就像是，他们就是你的人。

1379
00:54:38.220 --> 00:54:40.540
They're the people you're in the trenches with
他们是和你并肩作战、同甘共苦的人，

1380
00:54:40.540 --> 00:54:42.140
and you adore them.
而你深爱着他们。

1381
00:54:42.140 --> 00:54:44.140
And so when that name floats by,
所以当那个名字飘过时，

1382
00:54:44.140 --> 00:54:47.300
it's just a name to the person sitting in.
对于坐在屏幕前的人来说，它只是一个名字。

1383
00:54:47.300 --> 00:54:49.020
And they shouldn't feel the same.
他们不应该有相同的感受。

1384
00:54:49.020 --> 00:54:51.460
Yeah, affection obviously, they're not going to.
是的，他们当然不会有那种喜爱之情。

1385
00:54:51.460 --> 00:54:55.300
But it is an honoring of all the people.
但这是对所有这些人的致敬。

1386
00:54:55.300 --> 00:54:56.620
You know, and when people win awards
你知道的，当人们获奖时

1387
00:54:56.620 --> 00:54:59.300
and they think the crew, like it means so much.
他们感谢幕后工作人员，这意义重大。

1388
00:54:59.300 --> 00:55:00.300
It's really meaningful.
真的很有意义。

1389
00:55:00.300 --> 00:55:02.340
I don't know if you've ever talked about this before,
我不知道你们以前是否讨论过这个，

1390
00:55:02.340 --> 00:55:06.300
but every year, one of the cast members
但是每年，其中一位演员

1391
