00:56:30.300 --> 00:56:33.500
Ha, ha, ha, I forgot about that.
哈哈哈哈，我都忘了这事了。

1429
00:56:33.500 --> 00:56:34.740
That's so funny.
太搞笑了。

1430
00:56:34.740 --> 00:56:35.580
Yeah.
是啊。

1431
00:56:35.580 --> 00:56:36.580
Oh my God.
噢，天哪。

1432
00:56:36.580 --> 00:56:37.580
So.
所以。

1433
00:56:37.580 --> 00:56:38.580
Pure people.
单纯的人们。

1434
00:56:38.580 --> 00:56:40.300
To bring it back to the episode from one more second
为了再把话题拉回这一集一会儿，

1435
00:56:40.300 --> 00:56:42.300
and before we finish with the one thing we should also talk about
在我们结束“唯一一件事”的讨论之前，我们还应该聊聊，

